{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25789","headline":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 初出淝口入淮 · 李绅","name":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 初出淝口入淮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风百里雪初晴，淝口冰开好濯缨。\n野老拥途知意重，病夫抛郡喜身轻。\n人心莫厌如弦直，淮水长怜似镜清。\n回首夕岚山翠远，楚郊烟树隐襄城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}